/: uav_analysis_criteria.ncds
/: UAV Analysis Criteria — load defaults and refine with operator in discussion
/:
/: Dispatched from uav_error_check.ncds via Distribute.
/: Loads default criteria for the mission type, presents them to the operator,
/: and enters a discussion loop so the operator can modify, add, or remove
/: criteria before analysis begins. Returns finalised criteria.
/:
/: Execution order (inside-out, top-down):
/:   default criteria     — load rule-based defaults for mission type  (depends on approved plan)
/:   on-going discussion  — self-seed empty                            (no deps)
/:   all discussion turns — ReAct loop: present + refine with operator (depends on defaults)
/:   finalised criteria   — confirmed by operator                      (root)

<- finalised criteria
    <= confirm and return operator-approved criteria

    <- default criteria
        <= load default analysis criteria for this mission type
        <- approved plan

    <- on-going discussion
        <= initialize to empty discussion

    <- all discussion turns
        <= for every on-going message

            <= return the discussion turn per iteration

            <- discussion turn
                <= bundle criteria state and operator response together

                <- current criteria
                    <= apply operator modifications to current criteria
                    <- operator modifications
                        <= extract requested modifications from operator message
                        <- operator message
                        <- current criteria
                    <- current criteria
                    <- default criteria

                <- response sent
                    <= present current criteria to operator and await input
                    <- operator message
                        <= read operator input

            <- <criteria approved>
                <= judge if operator has approved the criteria
                <- operator message
                <- current criteria

            <- on-going discussion
                <= append current message to discussion
                    <= if criteria NOT yet approved
                    <* <criteria approved>
                <- operator message
                <- on-going discussion

        <- on-going discussion
        <* message in on-going discussion

    <- approved plan
